  <description value="The broad physical class of molecule represented by a MolecularDefinition resource instance: DNA, RNA, or amino acid (polypeptide). Codes are intentionally limited to top-level molecule classes to support consistent searching and profiling across systems. For finer-grained classification, use the type element bound to MolecularDefinitionType."/>
